[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:18. He Often Does This]
[00:00.660]Passage 18 | 文章十八
[00:02.550]He often does this. | 他经常这样做。
[00:06.125]After I had had lunch at a village inn, | 我在乡村小旅店吃过午饭之后，
[00:10.615]I looked for my bag. | 我就找我的包。
[00:12.830]I had left it on a chair beside the door, | 我把它放在门旁边的一把椅子上，
[00:16.085]and now it wasn't there. | 可现在它不见了。
[00:18.805]As I was looking for it, | 就在我找包的时候，
[00:21.280]the innkeeper came in. | 旅店老板走了进来。
[00:24.045]Did you have a good meal? he asked.| “你吃得好吗？” 他问道。
[00:28.250]Yes, thank you, I answered, | “是的，谢谢你，” 我回答说，
[00:31.430]but I can't pay the bill. | “但是我付不了账。
[00:34.215]I haven't got my bag. | 我的包不见了。”
[00:37.085]The innkeeper smiled | 旅店老板笑了笑，
[00:39.950]and immediately went out. | 立刻走了出去。
[00:42.685]In a few minutes, he returned with my bag, | 几分钟之后，他拿着我的包回来了，
[00:47.070]and gave it back to me. | 并把它还给了我。
[00:49.305]I'm very sorry, he said. | “我非常抱歉，” 他说。
[00:52.775]My dog had taken it into the garden. | “我的狗把它叼到花园里去了。
[00:56.040]He often does this. | 它经常这样做。”